                           mands known to nnttppqq.  A ‘?’ followed by a command
                           name will print function and usage information
                           about the command.
           aaddddvvaarrss _n_a_m_e[=_v_a_l_u_e][,...]
           rrmmvvaarrss _n_a_m_e[,...]
           cclleeaarrvvaarrss
